# Tooling-only dependencies for the AI unit-test agent.
#
# These are deliberately kept out of backend/requirements.txt: the agent,
# verifier and publisher are separate packages and must not alter the app's
# runtime dependency set. Everything needed to run the app's own tests comes
# from backend/requirements.txt and frontend/package-lock.json inside the
# sandbox, exactly as the app ships them.
#
# Regenerate the hashed lock file:
#   cd ai_test_agent
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file=requirements.lock requirements.in
